                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 11.6 – Clothing Change During Duty Hours",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                545,
                724,
                575
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    724.0,
                    545.0
                ],
                [
                    724.0,
                    575.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    575.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. When clothing being worn by an Employee has become contaminated with hazardous materials the Employee will be permitted to change clothing.",
            "block_bbox": [
                134,
                600,
                973,
                659
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    134.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    973.0,
                    600.0
                ],
                [
                    973.0,
                    659.0
                ],
                [
                    134.0,
                    659.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. In cases where the Employee does not have a spare uniform readily available and/or adequate hygienic facilities are unavailable at the worksite/work-section, excused absence, based on the time necessary to change clothing or the need for an Employee to return to his residence to change his or her clothing, may be granted to the Employee by the Agency or designated representative.",
            "block_bbox": [
                131,
                684,
                1083,
                827
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
